# Training / Coaching / LMS

Coaching sessions (with agent acknowledgement + optional quiz), a knowledge
library (topics / resources / quizzes), and trainer reporting. Follows
[.cursor/rules/backend-api-conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/backend-api-conventions.mdc).

## Backend map (`backend/src/`)

Coaching logic lives across controllers + trainer services — there is only a thin
`services/coaching/coaching.notify.ts` (status-change emails), NOT a big coaching
service folder. There is NO `course` service and NO `course.routes.ts`.

- Controllers: `coaching.controller.ts` (trainer session CRUD/lifecycle),
  `coachingReport.controller.ts`, `quiz.controller.ts` (attempt submit/history),
  `quizLibrary.controller.ts`, `resource.controller.ts` (KB resources + topic
  tagging via `list_items`), `csr/coaching.controller.ts` (CSR self-service),
  `trainer/*` (dashboard, reports, submissions, health).
- Services: `services/trainer/*` (reports, dashboard stats, team, health).
  `utils/coachingAutoAdvance.ts` auto-advances session status after a quiz/CSR
  action — reuse it rather than hand-advancing status.
- Routes: `routes/trainer.routes.ts` (`/api/trainer`), `routes/quiz.routes.ts`
  (`/api/quizzes`); CSR coaching/quiz reads live on `routes/csr.routes.ts`; admin
  session management on `routes/admin.routes.ts`.
- Topics are `list_items` (generic list API), not a dedicated table/service.
- QC coaching analytics (`QCCoachingData.ts`, `insightsQC` coaching reads) are
  read-only warehouse SQL — see
  [.cursor/rules/insights-data-warehouse.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/insights-data-warehouse.mdc).

## Frontend map (`frontend/src/`)

- `pages/training/` — coaching (`CoachingSessionsPage`, form/detail, `MyCoaching*`)
  and library (`LibraryTopicsPage`, `LibraryResourcesPage`, `LibraryQuizzesPage`,
  `LibraryQuizFormPage`) + `TrainingReportsPage`. `coaching-form/*` and
  `training-detail/layout.tsx` hold shared pieces.
- `components/training/` — `QuizBuilder`, `QuizPlayer`, `QuizPreviewModal`, plus
  coaching/library UI (filter bar, tab nav, topic chips, attachment cards).
- Rich text uses `components/common/RichTextEditor.tsx` (TipTap) — there is no
  `components/course/` slide editor. API client: `services/trainingService.ts`.
  Obey [.cursor/rules/ui-design.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/ui-design.mdc).
